// UpdateExtension update an extension
//
// An empty password keeps the current one.
//
// Parameters:
//
//	number: Required `string` value serialized in the `number` wire field.
//	displayName: Optional `string` value serialized in the `displayName` wire
//	field.
//	isEnabled: Optional `boolean` value serialized in the `isEnabled` wire
//	field.
//	password: Write-only: required on create, optional on update (empty keeps
//	the current one). Never returned. A manually configured phone registers with
//	it; while the agent is signed in to the panel their handset holds a
//	server-issued SIP session (POST /agent/sip-session) and that credential
//	takes precedence.
